---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { business } from "../lib/business";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Elite Balaji Stones & Ceramics"
  description="How Elite Balaji Stones & Ceramics handles information on this website."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-20">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-bottle">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink-soft">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-IN", { year: "numeric", month: "long", day: "numeric" })}</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        This website does not run analytics, advertising trackers, or cookies of its own, and it has
        no server-side backend — there is nowhere for a form on this site to send your data to, because
        every enquiry link on this site opens WhatsApp or your email app directly on your own device.
      </p>
      <p>
        The enquiry form on the <a href="/contact/" class="text-bottle hover:underline">Contact</a> page
        builds a WhatsApp or email link from what you type — nothing is stored or transmitted to us
        until you personally send that WhatsApp message or email.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you contact us by phone, WhatsApp, or email, we receive whatever information you choose to
        share (name, phone number, enquiry details) through that channel, the same as any normal phone
        call or WhatsApp conversation. We use it only to respond to your enquiry.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is hosted by a third-party static hosting provider, which may log standard technical
        information (such as IP address and browser type) for security and performance purposes, as is
        normal for any website.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent to{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`} class="text-bottle hover:underline">{business.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
